── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────── E0100_c_conditional_operator.lt:1:32  [E0100]

Stilt has no `? :`: an `if` gives a value, as `if c { a } else { b }`:

  1 │ fn sign(n: i64) -> i64 { n > 0 ? 1 : 0 }
    │                                ^

An `if` with `else` is an expression, so it stands wherever a value does.

To fix it, write an `if`:

  1 │ fn sign(n: i64) -> i64 { if n > 0 { 1 } else { 0 } }
    │                          +++      ~   ~~~~~~~~  ++
